  "description": "Universal zero-dependency networking core for .NET: TCP+UDP channels over one connection, reliable UDP with packet batching, every packet authenticated (AES-GCM or HMAC), server identity pinning, connection approval, WebSocket transport for browsers, a relay with UDP hole punching, time sync and LAN discovery — with zero allocations per message. netstandard2.1 (Unity 2021.2+) and net8.0 (NativeAOT), one wire protocol.",
